<%- include('partials/header') %>
    <div id="landing-block">
        <%- include('svgs/logo') %>
        <p>Throw an <strong>unforgettable</strong><br>gender reveal.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
        <h2>Why Use Gender Reveal Bingo Party?</h2>
        <img src='/images/announce-girl.svg'>
        <p>Gender Reveal Bingo party puts the power <strong>in the hands of your guests</strong>.</p>
        <p>Instead of watching the gender reveal, you and your guests <strong>compete to reveal the baby's gender</strong>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
        <h2>How Does It Work?</h2>
        <div class="dynamic-grid">
            <div class="instruction-card center">
                <div>
                    <p class="emoji">🚪</p>
                    <p class="title">Guests Arrive</p>
                </div>
                <p class="details">Guests make their prediction by selecting a <strong>boy</strong> or <strong>girl</strong> bingo card.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="instruction-card center">
                <div>    
                    <p class="emoji">💻</p>
                    <p class="title">Registration</p>
                </div>
                <p class="details">The host registers the bingo cards with our <strong>unique</strong> game player.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="instruction-card center">
                <div>
                    <p class="emoji">🆚</p>
                    <p class="title">The Game Begins!</p>
                </div>
                <p class="details">Our game player <strong>"randomly"</strong> draws numbers.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="instruction-card center">
                <div>
                    <p class="emoji">🎬</p>
                    <p class="title">Behind the Scenes</p>
                </div>
                <p class="details">The game is <strong>rigged</strong> in favor of one, correct player.<br><br><strong>Winning Card = Baby's Gender</strong></p>
            </div>
            <div class="instruction-card center">
                <div>
                    <p class="emoji">🎉</p>
                    <p class="title">Bingo!  It's a...</p>
                </div>
                <p class="details">The <strong>winner</strong> reveals the baby's gender.<br><br><strong>Not a smoke cannon...</strong></p>
            </div>
            <div class="instruction-card">
                <div>
                    <p class="emoji">▶</p>
                    <p class="title">Watch Here</p>
                </div>
                <p class="details">Watch the video your guests will see.</p>
                <a href="/intro-video" class="button">Watch Intro</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
        <h2>What Do I Need?</h2>
        <p>Only three things are needed to host a gender reveal bingo party.</p>
        <div class="dynamic-grid">
            <div class="instruction-card">
                <p class="emoji">📌</p>
                <p class="title">A Game Session</p>
                <p class="details">Sessions cost <%- price %> + tax.</p>
                <p class="details">Sessions are easy to create and launch.</p>
                <a href="/purchase-game/checkout" class="button">Purchase a Game</a>
            </div>
            <div class="instruction-card">
                <p class="emoji">📌</p>
                <p class="title">Our Special Cards</p>
                <p class="details">Cards are FREE!</p>
                <p class="details">Our bingo player only works with our cards.</p>
                <a href="/how-to#about-cards" class="button">About Cards</a>
            </div>
            <div class="instruction-card">
                <p class="emoji">📌</p>
                <p class="title">TV or Large Screen</p>
                <p class="details">(optional)</p>
                <p class="details">You'll want your guests to see everything in real time.</p>
                <a href="https://amzn.to/4sarfIM" class="button">Shop Amazon</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
        <h2>More About Us</h2>
        <p>We are a small business founded in Idaho.</p>
        <p>We believe family is something to be celebrated.</p>
        <p>When you support Gender Reveal Bingo Party, you support a young couple with their first child on the way!</p>
    </div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>